        "original_id": "0493f2dc-159a-5d84-8b5f-62be5f378cd8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dennis Ritchie, Ken Thompson\n- Organizations: Bell Labs\n- Products: Darwin, C programming language, Unix operating system\n- Systems: IBM 7090 mainframe\n\nFacts:\n- Darwin was developed at Bell Labs and was played there on an IBM 7090 mainframe.\n- Dennis Ritchie is sometimes incorrectly cited as a co-author of Darwin, but he was not involved in the game.\n- Dennis Ritchie created the C programming language.\n- Dennis Ritchie and his long-time colleague Ken Thompson created the Unix operating system.",
